    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marble Allstars is a classic online 3D platformer marble game. Compete on the leaderboards or parkour creative routes- the trials of becoming an all-star await you! Play through the campaign at your pace! Plenty of routes for you to find along the way.<br><br>Players can play through 60 different levels collecting all kinds of cool and crazy cosmetics. Find a large collection of nostalgic marble colorways or buy pa<br><br>Compete on the leaderboards globally! Each level displays the top 10 player times and then displays your rank and time so each player can see their position on the leaderboard.<br><br>The game is designed and formatted in a handful of platformer styles ranging from playground to downhill bombers putting the player through  all kinds of speed running combinations for the allstar experience.<br><br>Enjoy the online experience with anyone globally-as you play through the levels, as long as there is another player on your level you'll be able to see them as well!\u00a0</p>",
